# EMBODIED // OS — environment reference
# The app runs with ZERO env vars (local mode: no accounts, browser-only progress
# with export/import). Everything below is optional.

# ── Accounts + cross-device sync (recommended) ────────────────────────
# Provision via Vercel → Storage → Upstash for Redis; these are injected
# automatically when you link the database. Set manually only for other hosts.
# (The auth signing secret is auto-generated INTO Redis — no secret env var exists.)
KV_REST_API_URL=
KV_REST_API_TOKEN=

# Accepted fallbacks (plain Upstash provisioning outside the marketplace):
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# ── Emergency admin recovery (leave unset in normal operation) ────────
# If the only admin is locked out: set this to a long random string, redeploy,
# POST {username, newPassword, token} to /api/auth/recover, verify login,
# then UNSET it and redeploy again. Full runbook: docs/recalibration/RECOVERY.md
ADMIN_RESET_TOKEN=
